    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d534">

                <pb facs="0537" n="365" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg365"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/928</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stimson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-11T00:00:00-04:16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 11, 1917, midnight</hi></date>. <lb/>
                            [<hi rendition="#italic">Received November 12, 2.25
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>President of Argentina is urging congress of neutrals in January on chanceries of
                    countries below named. Ministers, Brazil and Uruguay informed me to-night that
                    new President of Bolivia would accept, [that] Uruguay will also because she is
                    such a close neighbor, but that Chile wishes first to see program before
                    accepting; Ecuador likely to follow Peru. Brazil alone excluded.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
